# Anthropic Claude API Key
# Get your API key from: https://console.anthropic.com
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# GitHub Personal Access Token (for feature requests and exports)
# Create a token at: https://github.com/settings/tokens/new?scopes=repo&description=AttachmentLens
# Classic token (recommended): Check the top-level 'repo' scope for private repos
# Fine-grained token: Select 'AttachmentLens' repository with Contents → Read and write
GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_... or github_pat_...
